L3-R2 DRY RUNS of the prepared owner-decision scripts, each chain on a fresh copy of the registry.
Placeholder words 'dry run', date 2026-10-01. Nothing in the tree is written. Rows L3-OD1, L3-OD2, L3-OD4 and L3-OD6 are
held by D-22 and D-23 for the tree's registry; a copy is not held, so each prepared change is exercised here. Row L3-OD4's band and
row L3-OD3's keep figures and row L3-OD6's coverage figures come from FIXTURE files standing in for the checked
energy basis, which is not filed yet;
the push is a placeholder of 20 N standing in for the owner's number.

